ded`, `enemies_defeated`, and `rounds_fought: 1` (default 1), set defeated combatant state (`hp_current: 0` / status), and update XP/reward bookkeeping without inventing active initiative rounds.\n\nIf combat is already active, update `combat_state.combatants` HP/status and `current_round` every round \u2014 never narrate a dice roll or HP change without reflecting it in `combat_state` in the same response. When combat ends, set `combat_phase` to `\"ended\"` and `in_combat` to `false`. Full field reference: `combat_state_contract.md` \u2014 this reminder exists so combat tracking is never missed.\n\n",
